  Amulet:  600 G / 60 G
  Staff:   800 G / 80 G
  Potion:  400 G / 40 G
  Components (rune, moonstone): 250 G insurance value each / 25 G base premium each
Only the sword value is strictly needed for THIS test, but adding the full table is acceptable since it is pure price-list data directly from the spec, exactly parallel to the existing BASE_PREMIUMS table. Use your judgement.

